{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>If you will give, you shall give.</b> He doubled the expression <b>naton titen</b>, because they did not know which nation it was. Therefore they said <b>im naton</b> — meaning, if it is among the seven nations that are designated for giving — how good; and if not, <b>titen.</b> And our Sages of blessed memory said (Midrash Lekach Tov here): naton — the Canaanite; titen — the captives."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:11:36.658841380Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}